Error [E3305]: `core.net.tls` is not available for target `wasm32-wasip2`.
  --> tests/ui/wasip2_unsupported_tls_surface_e3305.jet:2:5
    |
  2 | use core.net.tls as tls
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The selected target has no Prelude adapter for `core.net.tls`; WASI Preview 2 provides TCP/UDP sockets but not this operation.
 Fix: Use a supported TCP/UDP operation, or build for a native target.
